  "details": "Basically, every time I or anyone else moves, whether it be in desktop or VR, the avatar has developed a new bug (Every single avatar) where it readjusts its stance suddenly after you stop moving. As a result, all dynaminc bones jolt in the direction of the readjust if you have any. Making it an even worse problem the more effort you put into a character.\n\nHere's a video I took explaining and demonstrating the effects: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FQYwvInug9c&feature=youtu.be",
